      "on Gen 2, PACK and SAVE dim during a Bug Catching Contest, matching "
        .. "the cart hiding PACK and swapping SAVE for QUIT; the contest "
        .. "cannot be quit from the phone, because quitContest never leaves "
        .. "the engine's own start menu screen",
      "the status bar clock reads real-world time, which sits outside "
        .. "the fiction",
      "the phone draws its own 4x6 face for every label it shows -- app "
